# analyses of compounds with affixes that have COMPOUNDEND, COMPOUNDMIDDLE
# or COMPOUNDFORBIDFLAG: a prefix left from an earlier split point, twofold
# suffixes, forbidden stems
SET UTF-8
COMPOUNDFLAG C
COMPOUNDEND E
COMPOUNDMIDDLE M
COMPOUNDFORBIDFLAG F
FORBIDDENWORD X
COMPOUNDPERMITFLAG P

PFX R Y 1
PFX R 0 re/E .

PFX S Y 1
PFX S 0 se/M .

PFX T Y 1
PFX T 0 te/F .

SFX A Y 1
SFX A 0 s/BP .

SFX B Y 1
SFX B 0 0 .
